>Please make sure your repeater info on radioid.net is correct to help us automatically build accurate codeplugs.<br><br>73’s,<br>Luca<br>VE2WKR<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=1214">ve2wkr</a> — Wed Oct 16, 2024 8:09 pm</p><hr />
